{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1273411-classic-world-of-darkness-subscription","id":1273411,"title":"Classic World of Darkness subscription","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-08T02:31:45-08:00","id":1273411,"title":"Classic World of Darkness subscription","content":"It's my first post here, so first of all I'd like to say hello to everyone.<br /> <br /> To be honest I'm not sure it's the right place to ask my question, but I'm finding it quite difficult to get any answers elsewhere. So here it goes. Recently I've discovered that I can't purchase the Classic World of Darkness subscription on the official online store (or anything else for that matter) and I was wondering if anyone here would know what's going on. Is it connected to the V5 Guide to Camarilla situation, or is it some sort of local issue? My apology if I'm looking for answers at the wrong place and many thanks in advance for any help I might receive. <br /> <br /> On a side note, really enjoying reading through the posts here, hope to visit more often as I'm slowly trying to go back to storytelling after a 6+ years break.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24906-resout","name":"Resout","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T09:55:09-08:00","id":1273457,"title":"","content":"What do you mean by a subscription? AFAIK, there has never been an official WoD subscription service. WW's own storefront, and the DriveThruRPG storefront shared by WW and Onyx Path for the WoD offer individual products.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T10:12:22-08:00","id":1273461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1273411-classic-world-of-darkness-subscription?p=1273457#post1273457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you mean by a subscription? AFAIK, there has never been an official WoD subscription service. WW's own storefront, and the DriveThruRPG storefront shared by WW and Onyx Path for the WoD offer individual products.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/whitewolfpublishing/videos/10156205927375465/\" target=\"_blank\">I believe Resout is referring to this.</a><br /> <br /> Which yeah, I just looked on my account and checking the subscription tab, going through pages and actually getting to the &quot;select a subscription option&quot;, nothing shows up and I can't purchase a subscription.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T11:15:59-08:00","id":1273470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1273411-classic-world-of-darkness-subscription?p=1273461#post1273461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/whitewolfpublishing/videos/10156205927375465/\" target=\"_blank\">I believe Resout is referring to this.</a><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, exactly what I meant (IMO it was an excellent deal to get legal access to some pre-V20 stuff) and thank you for confirming that it's not a local issue. Sadly it leads me to believe that it might be related to the recent WW problems. Still I hope the service will be brought back eventually. Again, thanks for the help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24906-resout","name":"Resout","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-01T10:13:52-08:00","id":1277853,"title":"","content":"I received this on `12/19:<br /> &quot; <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Dear White Wolf Customer,</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Thank you for being a subscriber to the White Wolf online book reader service. It has been a great privilege to share with you so many of the books that are part of the rich World of Darkness history!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We regret to inform you that, due to internal changes at White Wolf, the subscription service will be terminated on <b>Thursday, 20 December</b>, along with the worldofdarkness.com website. After <b>20 December</b> you will no longer be able to access the service, and you will receive a full refund for any fees you have paid for as follows:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u>Example with Annual Subscription</u>: if you paid for an annual subscription and have used only 5 months of the service, you will receive a full refund for the unused 7 months.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u>Example with Monthly Subscription</u>: if you paid for a monthly subscription you will receive a full refund for this month.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Refunds will be issued in the first quarter of 2019.</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why is this happening?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">On 16 November, White Wolf announced that it is starting a period of restructuring. It will be integrated directly into Paradox Interactive, and under temporary management during this process. We are recruiting new leadership to guide White Wolf both creatively and commercially into the future, a process that has been ongoing since September.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Going forward, White Wolf will focus on brand management. This means White Wolf will develop the guiding principles for its vision of the World of Darkness, and give licensees the tools they need to create new, excellent products in this story world. White Wolf will no longer develop and publish these products internally. This has always been the intended goal for White Wolf as a company, and it is now time to enact it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Closing the online book subscriptions and worldofdarkness.com is part of this restructuring and refocusing process. We deeply regret this inconvenience to you, and the very short notice. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">If you have any questions or comments about this, we welcome them at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1a73747c755a6d72736e7f376d75767c34797577\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"3950575f56794e51504d5c144e56555f175a5654\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Thank you and Best Regards,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#202020\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">White Wolf&quot;<br /> <br /> I returned an email asking about the products that I had purchased from the website outside the subscription and quickly got a response from Jason Carl (Community and Marketing):<br /> <br /> &quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thanks for writing! We're working on a solution now to support PDF purchasers, and we'll update everyone when it's in place. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">In the meantime the site is still online if you need to download your PDFs. &quot;</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-01T10:49:22-08:00","id":1277860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1273411-classic-world-of-darkness-subscription?p=1273457#post1273457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you mean by a subscription? AFAIK, there has never been an official WoD subscription service. WW's own storefront, and the DriveThruRPG storefront shared by WW and Onyx Path for the WoD offer individual products.</div> </div> </div> </div>'Never' is a big word <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Back around 2000, there were subscriptions by game line. They offered a discount in their shop if you were a Camarilla member and since I was such an overzealous fan in those days, it was worth buying a membership for a year for that purpose.<br /> <br /> .. it was also the first time that I overdrafted my checking account by buying too much.<br /> <br /> Good times!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12228-spectrum","name":"Spectrum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-06T09:08:53-08:00","id":1278973,"title":"","content":"Thank you for all the information :-) While I eventually found out what had happened to the subscription service, I was wondering about the pdf core book I purchased. Luckily you cleared that up as well. Again thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24906-resout","name":"Resout","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}